# Colress (the scientist who wants to draw out the whole of a Pokémon's strength, cheerful and a little cold): a square-wave
# figure in D minor that climbs in even steps like a machine warming up, a pulsing synth bass, a bell answering and a tight beat.
# His theme when he steps up, on Route 22 and aboard the Plasma Frigate. Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U8, part b).
